cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MEYRO in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "MEYRO: Personalized Baseline Modeling for Longitudinal Multimodal Health Anomaly Detection"
abstract: >-
  MEYRO investigates whether personalized longitudinal baselines can identify
  meaningful deviations in individual behavioral and physiological signals more
  effectively, or with fewer false positives, than population-level baselines.
  This is a research system in progress; no results or clinical claims have been
  published. MEYRO is not a medical diagnostic system.
